            <ArticleTitle>Bioelectrodynamics: A New Patient Care Strategy for Nursing, Health, and Wellness.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>4-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/HNP.0000000000000129</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Bioelectrodynamics is an interdisciplinary subject that offers a pathway for nursing to develop a new patient care strategy in health care. The application of bioenergy to living organisms has the potential to advance medical science in the areas of prevention, cancer, wound care, pain, and many other chronic diseases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
